{"spread": 25, "blocks": [[{"t": "Bangkok added one more lesson: ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 61, 405, 75]}, {"t": "be patient. \u201cI was used to things ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 73, 403, 87]}, {"t": "happening much faster in the UK. I had ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 85, 433, 99]}, {"t": "to learn quickly to be patient.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 97, 389, 111]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 109, 246, 123]}, {"t": "Look a year ahead and he defines ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 121, 409, 135]}, {"t": "\u201cgood\u201d in simple terms. Two or three ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 133, 420, 147]}, {"t": "projects that made a visible difference, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 145, 435, 159]}, {"t": "work recognised for clarity, creativity ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 157, 428, 171]}, {"t": "and solid outcomes. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 169, 343, 183]}], [{"t": "A team that has grown in capability ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 193, 418, 207]}, {"t": "and confidence. Newer members ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 205, 404, 219]}, {"t": "stepping up. Shared habits that make ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 217, 428, 231]}, {"t": "collaboration smoother instead of ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 229, 411, 243]}, {"t": "draining. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 241, 288, 255]}], [{"t": "And when the year is done, he knows ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 265, 425, 279]}, {"t": "who he will call first: the small circle ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 277, 419, 291]}, {"t": "who challenged him, partners who ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 289, 412, 303]}, {"t": "helped make things happen, maybe ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 301, 418, 315]}, {"t": "a mentor who noticed the distance ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 313, 417, 327]}, {"t": "travelled.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 325, 291, 339]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 337, 246, 351]}, {"t": "For Mint, Thailand is not a one-off. It is ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 349, 430, 363]}, {"t": "the next chapter in a Southeast Asia ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 361, 423, 375]}, {"t": "story written the same way wherever ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 373, 425, 387]}, {"t": "we work: agile coordination, reliable ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 385, 418, 399]}, {"t": "programmes and quality you can see ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 397, 425, 411]}, {"t": "at handover. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [244, 409, 306, 423]}], [{"t": "Ask Nuno what he wants a client to say ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [456, 61, 648, 75]}, {"t": "at the end of a job and he does not ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [456, 73, 629, 87]}, {"t": "hesitate. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [456, 85, 501, 99]}], [{"t": "That Mint is trustworthy. That Mint ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [456, 109, 628, 123]}, {"t": "knows what it is doing. That they ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [456, 121, 618, 135]}, {"t": "would be happy to work with Mint ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [456, 133, 623, 147]}, {"t": "again.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [456, 145, 488, 159]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [456, 157, 459, 171]}, {"t": "That is how a first project becomes a ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [456, 169, 638, 183]}, {"t": "pipeline. One right decision, one right ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [456, 181, 639, 195]}, {"t": "relationship, one right project at a ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [456, 193, 623, 207]}, {"t": "time.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [456, 205, 480, 219]}]]}